\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. Just as I gave Thee all my love,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj So shall you also love yourselves.
\par Oh, Thou our Lord didst love so much,
\par Help us to offer Thee our love.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2. Help us to love one another,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And in Your church universal,
\par May we be sons of Thy Kingdom,
\par And members of Your body frame.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Just as Thou created the world,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And Thou didst grant her redemption
\par In much the same way shall true love,
\par Be in the hearts of all your sons.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  O Savoiur, make me love the same;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj That I shall not be put to shame,
\par When You shall come to judge mankind,
\par \pard     Lord, in Thy celestial kingdom.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

